      "text": "It give the pos based on semantic meaning \n\nb/w the word bcz it is AI Model and During training, the\n\nmodel learns patterns and relationships between words/texts.\n\nBecause of what it learned, semantically similar texts\n \ntend to produce vectors that are close together. while different \nmeanings tend to have  more distant vectors.\n ",
